      "text": "Transfer to the airport. Flight to Recife. Transfer to your hotel in Porto de Galinhas. Time for rest. The town is located in the south of the state, 60 km from the city of Recife. The town is known for its magnificent beaches, some of the most beautiful in the country. Clear turquoise water, clean white sand and palm trees on the shore give a unique flavor to this old colonial town.\n\nHotel Nannai Muro Alto, Double Bungalow with sea view, HB",
